         to retrieve protocol-dependent data that
         follows the HTTP message.
 
+        The octets are released: they are no longer
+        part of what the parser holds, and a later
+        @ref has_buffered_data returns false. The body
+        of the message, if any, is left as it is.
+
+        @par Preconditions
+        `this->is_complete() == true`, otherwise the
+        returned view is empty.
+
+        @par Postconditions
+        The returned view is invalidated by any
+        modifying member function.
+
         @return A string view of leftover data.
 
         @see @ref metadata::upgrade, @ref metadata::connection.
